#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:1 95523c807fde4146a8a6b469dadef8e3
msgid "🧠 API design"
msgstr "🧠 API 设计"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:3 4db683be902f47c793848b10129d639f
msgid ""
"All features take inputs and return outputs in the same way. A user who "
"knows one module knows them all. You declare everything on this page in "
"the [metadata](project:metadata.md)."
msgstr "所有特性都用相同的方式接收输入和返回输出。用户了解一个模块，就了解了所有模块。本页的所有内容都要在[元数据](project:metadata.md)中声明。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:7 5dc0d798f6784c51b1508478ccb0439a
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:9 8dd53b33fb90450e9b14838579a2a556
msgid ""
"A feature reads its inputs from a storage that has its name: "
"`<module>:<feature>`, at the path `in`. This applies to every type of "
"feature, such as functions, predicates, and number providers."
msgstr "特性从以它命名的存储 `<module>:<feature>` 的 `in` 路径读取输入。这适用于所有类型的特性，例如函数、谓词和数值提供器。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:16 5080d7807da0409c8dad9d3e723b63a3
msgid ""
"Use the executor, position, rotation, and dimension as inputs when you "
"can. `execute as <entity> at <position>` is simpler for users than an "
"argument."
msgstr "尽量把执行者、位置、旋转和维度用作输入。对用户来说，`execute as <entity> at <position>` 比参数更简单。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:17 6591125a1b29401f9752cdc21c6aa43a
msgid "Don't change the inputs."
msgstr "不要修改输入。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:18 1fe157b3b88840cb962d3b09412272ea
msgid ""
"Keep the arguments few and required. If a feature does two things, split "
"it into two features."
msgstr "参数要少，并且都是必需的。如果一个特性做两件事，请将它拆分为两个特性。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:19 a64e21238e3141e9863bd382b19a643a
msgid "When an argument is a command, name it `run` and make it a string."
msgstr "当参数是一条命令时，将它命名为 `run`，类型为字符串。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:23 088da622519f49ac86fc178e7dbbae2c
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:25 a3afb87ff56c4708bc3a4685a3fe0d06
msgid ""
"A feature returns its outputs in one or more of these ways. Don't use "
"scores as outputs."
msgstr "特性通过以下一种或多种方式返回输出。不要用分数作为输出。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:28 6b1c3b68d2af45eb8b6443261b753b47
msgid "**`storage`**"
msgstr "**`storage`**"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:29 3d5a8bbbcd1c4ea2bc445d67c2d39aa0
msgid "Data in the storage `<module>:<feature>`, at the path `out`"
msgstr "存储 `<module>:<feature>` 的 `out` 路径下的数据"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:31 175fe24ca6aa4bf483f620c228d15cae
msgid "*Example: `data get storage bs.xp:get_progress out`*"
msgstr "*示例：`data get storage bs.xp:get_progress out`*"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:32 ee0ca763d37a422abd0733c2aecb53d5
msgid "**`result`**"
msgstr "**`result`**"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:33 0439c04299094d7f82d847e6139079cc
msgid "The number that the feature returns"
msgstr "特性返回的数值"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:35 43fbab1ec59b4c4b8907d7430181fc13
msgid ""
"*Example: `execute store result score @s my_objective run function "
"#bs.hitbox:get_block/collision`*"
msgstr ""
"*示例：`execute store result score @s my_objective run function "
"#bs.hitbox:get_block/collision`*"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:36 1533bae7b32e4e559e5e04e764c9f960
msgid "**`success`**"
msgstr "**`success`**"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:37 0439c04299094d7f82d847e6139079cc
msgid "The feature succeeds or fails"
msgstr "特性成功或失败"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:39 c228b670cb3d4fdb94ad7aeea00442b5
msgid "*Example: `execute if function #bs.hitbox:is_in_block run say Inside`*"
msgstr "*示例：`execute if function #bs.hitbox:is_in_block run say Inside`*"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:40 5c0bf8134eea4231a9166dd9ed9c1134
msgid "**`state`**"
msgstr "**`state`**"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:41 9d9e601651fe47c5b367119fbec25186
msgid "A change in the world, such as a new block or a changed entity"
msgstr "世界中的变化，例如新放置的方块或被修改的实体"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:44 2d904216bef0421885f3cb5ec2120237
msgid ""
"If a function declares a `success` or a `result`, end every path with a "
"`return`:"
msgstr "如果函数声明了 `success` 或 `result`，请用 `return` 结束每条执行路径："

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:46 655c7d84251c4e2eacacc49bc732544c
msgid ""
"Use `return fail` when the function fails. `return 0` is a success that "
"returns 0."
msgstr "函数失败时使用 `return fail`。`return 0` 表示成功并返回 0。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:47 6adefa5c6bba4eecb3d3cc7e8d72f6ed
msgid "A function that ends without a `return` gives no result."
msgstr "没有 `return` 就结束的函数不会给出任何结果。"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:52 eab6512bda0d44ba809d58e863b8bc82
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:54 1a5cd90033814d4d8cef04509e81b491
msgid "Users call a function feature through its function tag:"
msgstr "用户通过函数标签调用函数特性："

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:61 cea1d018a30043479902415f741ef4bb
msgid "Macro call"
msgstr "宏调用"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:63 b792b3da6e97465abb0b6b11dd24e06e
msgid ""
"If you declare the function with `input arguments`, users can also call "
"it with a macro. They use the `.in` tag. Both calls do the same thing:"
msgstr "如果你使用 `input arguments` 声明函数，用户还可以用宏来调用它。这时使用 `.in` 标签。两种调用的效果相同："

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:69 9b6abf7aa9284c9a943f3bda1a253636
msgid "Optional arguments go in a `with` argument:"
msgstr "可选参数归入 `with` 参数："

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:75 32ec1d97788e439daef81a45d6579aee
msgid ""
"The build generates the `__macro__` function behind the `.in` tag. Write "
"it yourself when a macro is faster than a storage read. Then make "
"`__main__` call it:"
msgstr "构建过程会生成 `.in` 标签背后的 `__macro__` 函数。当宏比读取存储更快时，请自己编写它，然后让 `__main__` 调用它："

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:77 cd7c1ca6821547998a089d2f9ad596c1
msgid "add_levels/\\_\\_macro\\_\\_.mcfunction"
msgstr "add_levels/\\_\\_macro\\_\\_.mcfunction"

#: ../../contribute/api-design.md:82 1b0a8a0e684541e1acb6bde74994734f
msgid "add_levels/\\_\\_main\\_\\_.mcfunction"
msgstr "add_levels/\\_\\_main\\_\\_.mcfunction"

